<title>USA: GOLF-FINAL ROUND SCORES AT HOUSTON OPEN.</title>
<headline>GOLF-FINAL ROUND SCORES AT HOUSTON OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>THE WOODLANDS, Texas 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores</p>
<p>after the final round of the Houston Open golf tournament, won</p>
<p>by Phil Blackmar in a playoff on Sunday (U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p>276 Phil Blackmar 68 71 67 70, Kevin Sutherland 68 72 66 70</p>
<p>278 Steve Elkington (Australia) 69 74 70 65</p>
<p>279 Hal Sutton 68 72 71 68, Scott Hoch 73 68 68 70, Jerry</p>
<p>Kelly 70 68 69 72</p>
<p>281 Lanny Wadkins 73 70 71 67</p>
<p>282 Larry Rinker 72 69 71 70, Nolan Henke 73 71 68 70, David</p>
<p>Ogrin 69 68 74 71, John Morse 68 74 69 71, J.P. Hayes 73 72 64</p>
<p>73</p>
<p>283 Fred Funk 69 72 70 72, Craig Parry (Australia) 71 66 73</p>
<p>73</p>
<p>284 Scott McCarron 72 74 68 70, Justin Leonard 71 74 68 71,</p>
<p>Mike Reid 73 69 70 72, Neal Lancaster 71 72 69 72, David Duval</p>
<p>65 71 75 73</p>
<p>285 Tom Kite 71 73 70 71, Brent Geiberger 72 69 69 75, David</p>
<p>Sutherland 69 72 73 71</p>
<p>Add Non-U.S. scores</p>
<p>286 Grant Waite (New Zealand) 68 72 73 73</p>
<p>289 Phil Tataurangi (Australia) 72 72 74 71</p>
<p>290 Vijay Singh (Fiji) 71 71 71 77</p>
<p>298 Rafael Alarcon (Mexico) 76 70 82 70</p>
